+---
+title: 'Intelligent Extraction (Methods, Variables, Interfaces) - Finalization'
+type: 'feature'
+created: '2026-08-25'
+status: 'in-review'
+review_loop_iteration: 1
+context: ['/home/petrolal/cumulus.nvim/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/epic-2-context.md']
